splits this clinical sentence into 21
tokens and cuts tachycardia into 4 pieces.

3
00:00:11.979 --> 00:00:17.642
DeepSeek-V3, with about 129,000
tokens in its vocabulary,

4
00:00:17.642 --> 00:00:20.617
needs only 14.

5
00:00:20.817 --> 00:00:26.116
Long patient records need long context.
A model is trained on shorter text;

6
00:00:26.116 --> 00:00:29.014
rotating 8 times slower lets position

7
00:00:29.014 --> 00:00:33.359
32,768 land where 4,096 was.

8
00:00:33.359 --> 00:00:39.761
DeepSeek-V3 was stretched
from 4,000 to 32,000,

9
00:00:39.761 --> 00:00:43.750
then 128,000 tokens.

10
00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:48.651
Multi-token prediction adds a
second target during training.

11
00:00:48.651 --> 00:00:51.892
From the patient denies chest,
the main head predicts pain,

12
00:00:51.892 --> 00:00:55.849
and an extra module predicts
the token after next:

13
00:00:55.849 --> 00:01:01.350
and. This gives more training
signal and can speed up generation.

14
